  "cited_article_id": "troubleshoot-lab-interface",
  "reply": "Have a System Administrator open **Admin > Interfaces > Lab Connectivity**, locate the vendor, and run **Diagnostics**. If the status is offline, select **Action > Restart Service** and wait three minutes for the queue to flush. If the feed remains red, confirm that your firewall allows outbound traffic on port 443 to the gateway IP. Should the problem persist, note the error code from the event log and submit a support ticket with the specimen requisition numbers."
}
